<title>THAILAND: Banpu Q2 net profit up sharply. [CORRECTED 05:37]</title>
<headline>Banpu Q2 net profit up sharply. [CORRECTED 05:37]</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects headline to Q2 from Q4, and adjusts the text accordingly.)</p>
<p>Audited financial results for the second quarter ended December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				   Second quarter</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 5.31     vs	     3.16</p>
<p>    Net			276.55     vs	   157.26</p>
<p>				    Six months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		8.56	vs	     8.26</p>
<p>    Net		     441.32	vs	   409.31</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Banpu Plc, a coal mining firm.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
</text>
